<title>HONG KONG: GITIC Ent declares first final results.</title>
<headline>GITIC Ent declares first final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	     13.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)	nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	    nil</p>
<p>    Net				41.61</p>
<p>    Turnover			 332.47</p>
<p>    Company name		   GITIC Enterprises Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		    N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	     N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - GITIC Enterprises is a construction materials and property investment company which was listed on the Hong Kong stock exchange on March 26, 1997.</p>
<p>The company issued 100 million new shares at HK$1.05 each in its flotation. It said the net proceeds raised from the issue amounted to HK$90 million. The interest on application monies received amounted to HK$52 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
